  "headline": "FDA shortage list shows Jiangsu Hengrui daptomycin discontinued as of 2026-06-30; our supply is from Meitheal labeled product manufactured at Nanjing King-Friend with no FDA signal at that plant",
  "headline_cites": ["E4", "E3", "E1", "E2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The FDA shortage list records Jiangsu Hengrui Pharmaceuticals Co. daptomycin injection as discontinued with an initial posting date of 2026-06-30.",
      "cites": ["E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our inventory at both Corvale East and Corvale General is Meitheal Pharmaceuticals Inc. daptomycin (NDC 71288001791) per the SPL set ID 191f0224-67b7-4945-bdcd-38d60645e38c.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label for that SPL set names Nanjing King-Friend Biochemical Pharmaceutical Co. as the manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "There is no public FDA signal at the Nanjing King-Friend plant in the provided records.",
      "cites": ["E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 8 days on hand and Corvale General has 18 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Transferring 65 units from Corvale General to Corvale East would leave Corvale General with approximately two weeks of supply and bring Corvale East to about 12 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    }
  ]
}
